usage: qualify.py [-h] --repository REPOSITORY --baseline BASELINE
                  --source-root SOURCE_ROOT --compiler COMPILER --linker
                  LINKER --output OUTPUT

Cold-reproduce public-gradient HIA and execute the separate fixed suites.
Reports remain separate; their case/value counts are never summed into a count
of unique upstream tests. Hosted references are replayed, not generated here.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --repository REPOSITORY
  --baseline BASELINE
  --source-root SOURCE_ROOT
  --compiler COMPILER
  --linker LINKER
  --output OUTPUT
